    "id": "c007",
    "name": "Default",
    "text": "DEFAULT: You will be in default under th4+-Agreement if (1) you do not pay us what you owe yr~ader this Agreement on or before the payment date; (2) if you fail to perform your other promis: us; or (3) you fail to perform your obligations tot! ander, [you default, your obligations, less any uncarned charges, will become immediately due and payable, and you agree that we shall have the right to take any of the following actions to the extent allowed by applicable law: (1) we shall have the right to seck collection of any check or similar security you have provided us; and (2) we may exercise any other right or remedy allowed by law and this Agreement,"
