  {
    "id": "c008",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers",
    "text": "NOTICES AND WAIVERS; Except for aotices provided in this Agreement, you, and others responsible, to the extent permitted by law, waive demand, notice of nonpayment, notice of intention to accelerate, notice of acceleration, presentment, and notice of dishonor, To the extent permitted by law, you, and others responsible, also agree: we may waive or delay enforcing our rights without losing them; we are not required to file suit or arbitrate, show diligence in collection against you or others responsible, or go against any collateral; we may release or modify any person's liability without changing the liability of others; we may substitute, exchange or release any collateral; we may sue or arbitrate with one or more persons without joining or suing others; and we may renew or extend the obligations owed to us as often and for so long as we desire without notice to or approval by others responsible."
  },
  {
    "id": "c009",
    "name": "Waiver of Right to Trial by Jury",
    "text": "WAIVER OF RIGHT TO TRIAL BY JURY: You acknowledge that there is a constitutional right to trial by jury but it may be waived under certain circumstances, To the extent permitted by law, you, us, and Lender, knowingly and voluntarily waive any right to trial by jury in the event of litigation arising out of or related to this Agreement. This jury trial waiver shall not affect or be interpreted as modifying in any fashion the Jury Trial Waiver and Arbitration Agreement if you do not reject that Jury Trial Waiver and Arbitration Agreement."
