    "name": "Compliance",
    "text": "COMPLIANCE: It is the intention of CAB and Lender to comply with applicable law. In cach and every instance, CAB’s and Lender's respective rights are limited by applicable law (fo the extent they may not be lawfully waived), construed so as to comply with applicable laws, and CAB's and Lender's rights may not be exercised except to the extent permitted by applicable law, No charge or receipt by CAB or Lender, or any other person on CAB's or Lender's behalf, is intended to exceed lawful amounts, [fan unlawful excess occurs, it will be applied as a credit or otherwise refunded, and the rate or amount involved wil! automatically be reduced to the maximum lawful rale or amount, To the extent permitted by law, for purposes of determining CAB’s and Lender’s compliance with the law, CAB and Lender may calculate charges by amortizing, prorating, allocating and spreading."
  },
  {
