    "name": "Pre-Suit Notice Regarding Legal Compliance",
    "text": "PRE-SUIT NOTICE REGARDING LEGAL COMPLIANCE: Prior to initiating any claim that this agreement or related maticr, or any action or inaction by us or Lender, or by any other person, is legally non-compliant, illegal or unenforceable, you must provide us and Lender with detailed written notice of the claim and relief requested and a reasonable opportunity of not [ess than 60 days to cure the claim. Any notice to us or to Lender must be sent by certified mail, return receipt requested, to PLS Loan Store of Texas, Inc,, Attn, Legal Department, 300 North Elizabeth, 4th Floor, Chicago, IL. 60607, Any corrective action shall relieve us and Lender of any liability to the extent permitted by law, To the extent permitted by law, this requirement for pre-suit notice is cumulative of any notices and corrective-action procedures required by applicable flaw and other contract provisions,"
