    "name": "Collection Expenses",
    "text": "Collection Expenses: You agree to pay our reasonable attorneys’ fees if this Agreement is referred to an attorney for collection, regardless of whether legal proceedings are actually filed, and all costs and disbursements. A person may not threaten or pursuc criminal charges against you related to a check or other debit authorization provided by the consumer as sccurity for a loan, in the absence of forgery, fraud, theft, or other criminal conduct."
