    "name": "Governing Law",
    "text": "GOVERNING LAW: This Credit Services Agreement will be governed by the laws of the State of Texas, except that the Waiver of Jury Trial And Arbitration Provision is governed by the Federal Arbitration Act (“FAA”)."
  },
