    "id": "c029",
    "name": "Caution",
    "text": "CAUTION: THE CREDIT SERVICES WE PROVIDE AND THE LOAN WE MAY ARRANGE FROM LENDER ARE NOT INTENDED TO MEET LONG-TERM FINANCIAL NEEDS. SUCH CREDIT SERVICES AND LOAN SHOULD ONLY BE USED TO MEET IMMEDIATE SHORT-TERM CASH NEEDS, REPEATED OR FREQUENT USE CAN CREATE SERIOUS FINANCIAL HARDSHIPS, BEFORE ENTERING ANY AGREEMENT OR A SPECIFIC TRANSACTION, YOU SHOULD EVALUATE THE COSTS AND BENEFITS OF ALL ALTERNATIVES, INCLUDING A LOAN FROM ANOTHER LENDER (WITHOUT THE ASSISTANCE OF A CAB), A LOAN FROM FAMILY OR FRUENDS, A CREDIT CARD CASH ADVANCE, AN ADVANCE UNDER AN ACCOUNT WITH OVERDRAFT PROTECTION, OR A SALARY ADVANCE."
